c-shiji-098-fujin:p003","quote":"四月，擊陳豨，屬太尉勃，以相國代丞相哙擊豨。一月，徙為代相國，將屯。二歲，為代丞相，將屯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p004","quote":"孝惠五年卒，謚為景侯。子頃侯精立，二十四年卒。子共侯則立，十二年卒。子侯偃立，三十一年，坐與淮南王謀反，死，國除。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p013","quote":"太史公曰：陽陵侯傅寬、信武侯靳歙皆高爵，從高祖起山東，攻項籍，誅殺名將，破軍降城以十數，未嘗困辱，此亦天授也。蒯成侯周緤操心堅正，身不見疑，上欲有所之，未嘗不垂涕，此有傷心者然，可謂篤厚君子矣。"}],"rationale":"依傅寬、靳歙、周緤分段敘事及明示姓名定位；楚王信與平城下韓信分存，單稱參勃哙敞不補姓，兩位信武侯分持有人，周昌不按同名跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p001","text":"陽陵侯傅寬，以魏五大夫騎將從，為舍人，起橫陽。從攻安陽、杠里，擊趙賁軍於開封，及擊楊熊曲遇、陽武，斬首十二級，賜爵卿。從至霸上。沛公立為漢王，漢王賜寬封號共德君。從入漢中，遷為右騎將。從定三秦，賜食邑雕陰。從擊項籍，待懷，賜爵通德侯。從擊項冠、周蘭、龍且，所將卒斬騎將一人敖下，益食邑。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"陽陵侯","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"傅寬","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"趙賁","kind":"person","person_id":"bwv_p3h_q1j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"楊熊","kind":"person","person_id":"v4m_7yp_xr3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"寬","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m001-0105","start":105,"e